{"repositoryId":1376985157,"availability":"available","full":"kushals256/jevcache","name":"jevcache","description":"MorrowCache — skip the chat call when the question is the same. OpenAI-compatible proxy. npm: @kushalicious/jevcache","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":12,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-19T09:40:18Z","updated":"2026-10-03T12:21:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://morrowcache.vercel.app","topics":["cache","hono","llm","openai","openrouter","proxy","semantic-cache","typesafe","typescript"],"demo":"https://morrowcache.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.629Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.629Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.629Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.629Z","stars":12,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["MorrowCache — routers pick a model. This proxy decides whether to call one.","npm package and CLI stay @kushalicious/jevcache / jevcache (download history unchanged). Site: morrowcache.vercel.app.","A local OpenAI-compatible chat response cache. 2.0 (Agent Turn Cache) skips the model in two cases: the same question in different words, and an agent retrying the same job (same prior conversation, same-intent latest ask). It stores final assistant text only. A later stream of that answer can HIT. A response that contains toolcalls is returned and never stored."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kushals256/jevcache/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b83abfa229d66ff8f105e31e767654a438a4df88a66b07a1a7653ecc3d1e4d24","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.718Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:18.718Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"MorrowCache — routers pick a model. This proxy decides whether to call one.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/kushals256/jevcache/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required",